WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:08.450
<b>The New World</b>

3
00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:13.240
<b>Mink Guardians</b>

4
00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:10.600
We made it here in good time.

5
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.600
Master Cat Viper's a pretty
sharp navigator, isn't he?

6
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.980
Though I do suppose he sailed with
the King of the Pirates, after all.

7
00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.130
So. How long should we wait
at these ruins anyway?

8
00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:21.830
I feel like it's been a while.

9
00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:25.080
Until Master Cat Viper brings
Marco the Phoenix here, of course!

10
00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:27.920
Yeah? You think he'll do it? I dunno.

11
00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:31.020
I sure hope Marco comes with us
to the Land of Wano.

12
00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:33.650
The Phoenix would make for
a pretty powerful ally.

13
00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:36.760
[RODDY]
I mean, this guy is the former

14
00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:39.660
first division commander of the
infamous Whitebeard Pirates,

15
00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:42.150
so he's definitely worth
the effort of coming out here.

16
00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:45.860
I was surprised to find out he's
one of Master Cat Viper's friends!

17
00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:46.990
Good point!

18
00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:48.130
[RODDY]
Hm?

19
00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:51.300
[BB]
If this Marco's such a celebrity,
then I want to get a look at him.

20
00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.660
[RODDY]
Whoa! Wait!

21
00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:55.290
Let me remind you of something.

22
00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:59.270
Master said to stay put because
of your intimidating looks.

23
00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:03.080
Is Marco the kind of guy
who'll get scared off by a face?

24
00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:04.580
Listen here!

25
00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:06.820
He was referring to
that quaint little village

26
00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:09.300
of peace-loving folks
up there, you-gara fool!

27
00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:12.890
Big burly warriors like us
will frighten the locals!

28
00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:17.850
[BB]
I see. But Master Cat Viper's features
are scarier than mine, I would say!

29
00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:19.480
Like when he's mad?

30
00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:21.570
[BB]
Yeah, but he does have a cute smile.

31
00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:23.230
[RODDY]
Too true!

32
00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:31.280
<b>Onward to Wano</b>

33
00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:40.380
[Kids giggling]

34
00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:43.250
-[BOY A] There! -[GIRL A] Hey, wait!

35
00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:05.650
[MARCO]
Okay. He's all fixed up now.

36
00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:07.820
You're good to go.

37
00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:10.950
[gasps]
He said you're all better now!

38
00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:13.280
Tama? Feel good?

39
00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:20.440
[MARCO]
Don't push yourself too hard.

40
00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:24.540
The Flames of Restoration only
have a slight effect on others.

41
00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:31.760
<b>Marco
Former 1st Division Commander (Ship's Doctor)
Whitebeard Pirates</b>

42
00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:29.330
[MARCO]
Since I patched you up, your natural
healing speed will be faster now.

43
00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:35.830
You'll be bouncing around by tomorrow!

44
00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:37.920
[TAMA'S OWNER]
Marco's magic did the trick!

45
00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:40.300
Say "thank you," Tama!

46
00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:45.050
[roars]

47
00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:54.590
Yeah! Looks like you're back to normal!

48
00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:56.380
Oh boy!

49
00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:02.680
[MARCO]
Take it easy! I said "by tomorrow"!

50
00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:06.060
Thank you for the help, Marco!

51
00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:07.350
We love you! [giggles]

52
00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.330
[BOY B]
Marco.

53
00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:17.880
[SPHINX TOWNSPERSON A]
I got a knot in my shoulder.

54
00:03:16.510 --> 00:03:19.220
<b>Nekomamushi
Mink Guardians</b>

55
00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:19.960
[BOY C]
Marco, I saw a bug near the mountain.

56
00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:21.170
[SPHINX TOWNSPERSON B]
...field could use some TLC.

57
00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:24.100
Marco, I slipped a disc
in my back again!

58
00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:26.940
Marco, my knees ache.

59
00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:30.400
Marco, my little brother's
bein' real mean to me!

60
00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:32.190
All right, all right.

61
00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:35.570
I'll help you all, but one
at a time now, please.

62
00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:56.500
[MARCO]
Pops built this village, you know.

63
00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:59.510
So he took care of the people here?

64
00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:02.840
Is that's what you-gara mean?

65
00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:06.640
Countries that are too poor to pay
Heavenly Tribute to the Celestial Dragons

66
00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:09.180
are not allowed to join
the World Government at all.

67
00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:15.200
They tend to be lawless lands,
where pirates and kidnappers run amok.

68
00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:18.870
There's no one to stop them.

69
00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:22.450
[MARCO]
And when the country
succumbs to collapse,

70
00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:25.710
it churns out a fresh
generation of orphans.

71
00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:29.510
Pops was one of those kids.

72
00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:34.010
[MARCO]
With nothing left to lose,
he went out to sea at an early age.

73
00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:43.190
[MARCO]
Even after becoming a pirate,
he cared about this island.

74
00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:45.880
He'd funnel dirty money and
supplies here whenever he could,

75
00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:48.930
but he never revealed who he was.

76
00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:50.680
Did it till he died.

77
00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:56.400
[MARCO]
He never had a family, and his
friends were all long gone,

78
00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:58.860
but this island was always home to him.

79
00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:06.080
In a corrupt world, there's no such thing
as clean or dirty money. It's just money.

80
00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:07.710
[MARCO]
Heh.

81
00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:09.580
Nice of you to say.

82
00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:14.130
So after the war in Marineford,

83
00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:16.010
at the very least, we wanted to protect

84
00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:18.690
this village that Pops loved so much.

85
00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:22.020
That's why we started
a Grudge War with Teach

86
00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:24.950
when he tried to invade
our territory and claim it.

87
00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:29.620
[MARCO]
But we were no match for Teach,
especially after he stole Pops' power.

88
00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:34.170
[MARCO]
In the end, he took everything.

89
00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:41.980
I wanted him to pay,
and I wanted to do it myself.

90
00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:50.440
[MARCO]
Poor Pops.

91
00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:56.530
It's funny. He was
kind of a cheapskate.

92
00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:06.580
[MARCO]
He'd always
mooch drinks off of others...

93
00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:10.460
...and the guy never once
offered to cover our tab.

94
00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:16.800
But nobody said a thing, because
we all knew what he was doing

95
00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:18.880
with the money he saved.

96
00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:24.470
He was sending it to the village. Heh.

97
00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:27.790
Well, ain't that something.

98
00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:30.750
[CAT VIPER]
So that makes this peaceful little spot

99
00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:34.790
the last memento that
he left behind, doesn't it?

100
00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:37.550
[MARCO]
Yeah.

101
00:06:39.590 --> 00:06:41.050
He must be grateful.

102
00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:46.850
Red-Haired Shanks
made sure to bury him here.

103
00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:50.890
[MARCO]
By the way, have you heard
of a Warlord named Weevil?

104
00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:53.400
He said he's Pops' biological son,

105
00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:56.790
and now he's attacking people
connected to Whitebeard.

106
00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:58.750
Wow. Is her claim true?

107
00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:00.420
I'm not sure honestly.

108
00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:02.760
Never knew his taste in women.

109
00:07:02.760 --> 00:07:05.340
But if I had to guess,
they're after his fortune.

110
00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:08.510
And I doubt they'd believe us
if we said there wasn't one.

111
00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:10.430
[gasps]

112
00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:12.470
And you know what? It's a shame.

113
00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:15.020
It's only a matter of time
before they come for this place.

114
00:07:15.020 --> 00:07:18.910
[CAT VIPER]
I see. That means
you-gara are stuck here.

115
00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:24.870
Weevil's mother Buckin was a
pirate back in her younger days.

116
00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:29.540
If I recall correctly, it must
have been about 30 or 40 years ago.

117
00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:33.290
I even heard she used to be
on the very same ship as Pops.

118
00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:38.860
Then maybe, you-gara have
another mentor of his to protect.

119
00:07:38.860 --> 00:07:43.920
[laughs]
Not sure about that,
considering his behavior!

120
00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:45.340
A fine point!

121
00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:49.760
[both laugh]

122
00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:54.600
If you're going to see Straw Hat Luffy
after this, can you pass on a message?

123
00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:56.060
Nothing big.

124
00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:58.430
[CAT VIPER]
Yeah, not a problem.

125
00:07:58.430 --> 00:08:00.140
[MARCO]
You said you're going to Wano?

126
00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:01.310
[CAT VIPER]
Yep.

127
00:08:02.630 --> 00:08:06.010
<b>At Sea
New World</b>

128
00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:09.540
Luffy! It says the Reverie kicked off!

129
00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:12.210
Royalty from all over are attending!

130
00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:14.800
They're at the conference
in Marie Jois right now!

131
00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:16.050
[LUFFY]
Hmm.

132
00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:21.760
[NAMI]
"All eyes are on a set of guests who
haven't participated in two centuries!

133
00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:23.430
The Ryugu Kingdom!

134
00:08:23.430 --> 00:08:27.680
King Neptune will be in attendance
with all his children." Ha!

135
00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:31.440
Seems like Shirahoshi was
a big hit with everyone!

136
00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:34.570
That means she went up
to the surface, huh?

137
00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:35.860
She's getting tougher!

138
00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:37.030
I'm proud of her!

139
00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:43.420
<b>Captain "Straw Hat" Luffy
Straw Hat Pirates
Bounty: ¬1.5 Billion</b>

140
00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:41.950
It says here that your grandpa
was their personal escort.

141
00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.080
Ahh.

142
00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:47.260
Sounds like they're making arrangements
to relocate Fishmen to the land.

143
00:08:47.260 --> 00:08:49.180
Their dream's coming true!

144
00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:53.890
[gasps]

145
00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:56.310
Vivi, my sweet!

146
00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:58.690
You're even more beautiful
than I remember!

147
00:08:58.690 --> 00:09:01.650
I just wanna smooch ya! Mwah!

148
00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:03.650
What's that? You want another? Mwah!

149
00:09:03.650 --> 00:09:07.520
Oh, do I get some change back?
Lemme get in close!

150
00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:08.520
Knock it off!

151
00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:09.610
[thudding]

152
00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:13.470
Vivi!

153
00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:15.050
It's really her!

154
00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:17.980
Wow, that's awesome! It's been a while!

155
00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:20.360
She looks so elegant and formal now!

156
00:09:20.360 --> 00:09:23.730
Oh! I hope I get to meet her someday!

157
00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:26.820
Do you think Vivi might be
interested in showing me her panties?

158
00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:27.990
I don't think so!

159
00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:29.820
-[thudding] -[Brook groans]

160
00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:34.290
Ohh. These are photos
of the Mingling Plaza.

161
00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:36.040
Look at all the royal families.

162
00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:37.880
And tons of bodyguards, too!

163
00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:41.780
People from Dressrosa
should be there as well, right?

164
00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:43.490
There she is! Viola!

165
00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:51.980
[Chopper gasps]
Ugh! Wapol!

166
00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:53.820
[LUFFY]
Hey! And Acorn-guy!

167
00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:56.990
Huh? Wapol? Why's he there?

168
00:09:57.420 --> 00:10:00.170
[Luffy gasps]
That's Rebecca and Sai!

169
00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:02.340
I know a lotta these guys!

170
00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:03.890
No kidding!

171
00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:07.060
Though I suppose any royalty
we know would be at the Reverie.

172
00:10:07.060 --> 00:10:08.600
That's kind of the point.

173
00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:13.360
If that's the case, then just maybe...

174
00:10:13.910 --> 00:10:18.020
All the princesses I've ever met are
in the same place at the same time!

175
00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:22.380
I bet they're all getting
excited talking about me!

176
00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:24.550
[NAMI]
You keep thinking that, buddy.

177
00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:27.250
Chopper, look! Did you see?

178
00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:28.500
[CHOPPER]
Huh?

179
00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:29.830
Right there!

180
00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:33.130
[screams]

181
00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:35.260
Hey, Chobro. What's going on?

182
00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:46.060
It's Doctorine! [sobs]

183
00:10:46.420 --> 00:10:48.710
Uh... The old bag's still alive?

184
00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:58.050
[Chopper giggles]
Doctorine!

185
00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:00.720
Hey! Don't cut up the paper!

186
00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:02.480
I wanted to save it, Chopper!

187
00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:03.480
Whoa!

188
00:11:03.810 --> 00:11:05.480
[SANJI]
Give me the section
with the princesses!

189
00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:07.560
[NAMI]
What are you two doing?

190
00:11:13.570 --> 00:11:14.480
You morons!

191
00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:16.660
I wasn't finished reading it yet!

192
00:11:16.660 --> 00:11:18.410
It's all full of holes now!

193
00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:22.250
Oh? An article about Kaido?

194
00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:26.250
And Big Mom, too?

195
00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:28.510
Uh, hang on.

196
00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:30.760
Sanji! Chopper! Gimme those pages back!

197
00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:32.170
[BOTH]
– Nuh-uh!
– Nuh-uh!

198
00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.920
[both giggle]

199
00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:38.370
[giggles]
I'm glad to hear
everyone's doing so good!

200
00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:41.290
Once we're done sailing around
the world, let's go see 'em all!

201
00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:44.120
Well! That sounds like
a novel idea to me.

202
00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:46.670
Anyway, back to
getting things in order.

203
00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:49.550
Have you tried to see if the
Transponder Snail can connect yet?

204
00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:51.010
Oh, I forgot.

205
00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:53.440
Hey! This is Luffy!

206
00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:54.480
Is anyone there?

207
00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:59.530
No luck. Nobody picked up.

208
00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:01.280
Forget it. Let's go.

209
00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:05.440
[NAMI]
Hang on, Luffy!

210
00:12:05.730 --> 00:12:07.230
What's wrong now?

211
00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:09.030
Feel that wind?

212
00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:32.260
This can't be a good sign.

213
00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:34.130
I've never seen waves like those.

214
00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:36.930
And the wind here is freezing cold.

215
00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:45.850
But I think this is
the sea around Wano!

216
00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:57.860
Do you all feel how the wind keeps
getting stronger the closer we get?

217
00:12:57.860 --> 00:12:59.820
And the waves only grow taller?

218
00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:02.600
[NAMI]
Take notice of how it's spinning.

219
00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:04.020
That's not just from the wind currents.

220
00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:07.320
That's a very unusual flow.

221
00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:10.620
Look, see how it's
picking up over there?

222
00:13:20.310 --> 00:13:22.630
I believe we should avoid the storm.

223
00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:24.640
Maybe buy ourselves a little time?

224
00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:26.760
What are you talking about, Brook?

225
00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:27.890
Don't worry about that junk!

226
00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:28.970
Let's keep going!

227
00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:33.440
But Luffy. Why would you deliberately put
your crew in such a dangerous situation?

228
00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:36.770
I dunno, I think he's right.

229
00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:40.990
When we left, Kin'emon did
give me a heads up about this.

230
00:13:42.110 --> 00:13:45.570
I'll explain it, on the
auditory snail apparatus!

231
00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:48.120
As you approach the Land of Wano,

232
00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:51.370
you'll find the entrance
to be quite perilous!

233
00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:52.620
The weather, grueling.

234
00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:54.210
The tides, violently churning.

235
00:13:54.670 --> 00:13:56.670
It's a difficult country to enter!

236
00:13:57.260 --> 00:14:00.340
Huh? The weather is always this awful?

237
00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:03.030
I suppose we have no other
choice, if that's the case!

238
00:14:03.030 --> 00:14:05.330
And that's why we should just go!

239
00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:09.290
Their samurai warriors are mighty,
plus it's this hard to get into?

240
00:14:09.290 --> 00:14:11.500
No wonder it's such
an isolated country!

241
00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:15.210
[NAMI]
Hmm. Let me think this over a little.

242
00:14:15.210 --> 00:14:18.170
There has to be some way
to get us in there safely.

243
00:14:22.990 --> 00:14:24.620
[NAMI]
What's that thing?

244
00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:25.830
[LUFFY]
It's an octopus!

245
00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:27.200
That guy's big!

246
00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:28.910
[NAMI]
Why is it on the ship?

247
00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:29.920
[CARROT]
Because we're at sea!

248
00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:31.950
[NAMI]
I realize that, Carrot!

249
00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:34.500
[BROOK]
When did it come on board?

250
00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:39.340
Hey! While you're over there bickering,
those waters are pulling us in!

251
00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:40.420
Huh?!

252
00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:42.510
[LUFFY]
It doesn't matter!

253
00:14:42.510 --> 00:14:48.390
C'mon, Sunny! Let's go
to the Land of Wano!

254
00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:05.080
Hey! It looks like something's
coming towards us!

255
00:15:09.240 --> 00:15:11.160
Uh-oh. What is it?

256
00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:13.240
It kinda looks like a giant fish to me!

257
00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:14.540
Is it a shark?

258
00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:15.620
Please, no!

259
00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:18.630
It's gonna get us!

260
00:15:20.340 --> 00:15:22.710
[Nami, Chopper scream]

261
00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:29.140
[NAMI]
Koi fish?

262
00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:30.890
[CARROT]
Oh wow! Cool!

263
00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:35.450
He's huge! Ha!

264
00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:36.910
[octopus A grunts]

265
00:15:43.910 --> 00:15:45.210
A whole school of koi!

266
00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:54.980
What the hell are those
things doing in the sea?

267
00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:56.600
They're freshwater fish!

268
00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:58.150
How can they survive?

269
00:15:58.150 --> 00:16:01.150
[NAMI]
Who knows! They're monsters anyway!

270
00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:03.570
[LUFFY]
Hey, Sanji?
Do these things fry up okay?

271
00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:06.360
[NAMI]
That stuff's not important right now!

272
00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:08.350
I guess it's possible.

273
00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:12.440
If you wash them in hot water and then
serve them chilled, you can make arai.

274
00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:14.190
Or I can simmer them in some miso.

275
00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:17.600
[SANJI]
I can batter 'em up and make tempura
or simmer 'em in sweet sauce.

276
00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:20.230
[LUFFY]
Sounds good!

277
00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:24.520
Once we find the rest of the crew,
let's celebrate with one of these!

278
00:16:24.520 --> 00:16:26.190
You'll drown, Luffy!

279
00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:28.230
Plus, koi have way too many bones!

280
00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:29.910
Who cares about that?!

281
00:16:29.910 --> 00:16:31.910
That's the least important
thing right now, Carrot!

282
00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:33.740
[laughs]

283
00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:39.900
[LUFFY]
Hey! Don't struggle!

284
00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:41.820
[NAMI]
Of course it's gonna struggle!

285
00:16:41.820 --> 00:16:43.820
You think it's gonna
just let you eat it?

286
00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:46.960
And Sanji. You're the one who
put this dumb idea in his head,

287
00:16:46.960 --> 00:16:48.840
so you go bring him back!

288
00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:50.340
It's not that big of a deal.

289
00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:52.180
You know he can manage on his own.

290
00:16:52.180 --> 00:16:53.340
Huh?!

291
00:16:53.640 --> 00:16:55.510
Let's just worry about
protecting the Sunny.

292
00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:58.470
[octopus A grunts]

293
00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:18.550
[NAMI]
The wind is picking up!

294
00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:20.200
Carrot, furl the sail!

295
00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:21.340
[CARROT]
On it!

296
00:17:21.340 --> 00:17:22.720
[CHOPPER]
Lemme help!

297
00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:44.160
Crazy! Look how clean the water is!

298
00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.660
It's crystal clear,
like a mountain stream!

299
00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:48.160
[NAMI]
I'd rather not see,
thank you very much!

300
00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:51.710
The giant fish are freaking me out!

301
00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:54.210
Huh? Is this a river? No way.

302
00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:57.760
It looks like they're all
headed to the same place.

303
00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:01.220
[BROOK]
Hang on tight!

304
00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:02.720
We're just along for the ride now!

305
00:18:03.650 --> 00:18:05.270
Is Luffy still around?

306
00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:13.820
Huh?

307
00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:19.370
What the hell? How's that possible?

308
00:18:19.800 --> 00:18:21.890
The river's flowing into the waterfall,

309
00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:24.410
not away from it, like usual!

310
00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:38.900
I see. There must be a massive fresh
water source at the top of the falls.

311
00:18:39.350 --> 00:18:41.550
That's why it's not seawater.

312
00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:44.600
I wonder, could that be Wano up there?

313
00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:46.310
[SANJI]
You think that's it?

314
00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:48.430
[BROOK]
None of this makes any sense!

315
00:18:48.430 --> 00:18:50.390
I'm scared! Terrified!

316
00:18:50.390 --> 00:18:51.270
[octopus A grunts]

317
00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:52.310
Huh?

318
00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:14.300
[gasps]
Oh, cool!

319
00:19:14.300 --> 00:19:16.510
The fish are climbing the waterfall!

320
00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:18.010
[NAMI]
They are!

321
00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:27.710
[CARROT]
Go koi fish! Go koi fish!

322
00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:31.130
I'm not sure how we can
get the Sunny up there!

323
00:19:31.130 --> 00:19:32.510
We'll sink if we take it head on!

324
00:19:32.510 --> 00:19:34.720
Open to suggestions right now!

325
00:19:35.600 --> 00:19:36.890
[NAMI]
You're back!

326
00:19:36.890 --> 00:19:40.040
Wow! You see that? Those koi are tough!

327
00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:42.210
You can admire the fish later!

328
00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:44.800
Luffy! The ship's going to sink!

329
00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:46.100
[LUFFY]
Right! I got this!

330
00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:47.110
Huh?

331
00:19:48.970 --> 00:19:50.760
You should probably hang on tight!

332
00:19:50.760 --> 00:19:52.760
[grunts]

333
00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:58.460
[LUFFY]
Lead the way, fish!

334
00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:00.630
[NAMI]
Are you kidding me?!

335
00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:03.540
Let's go!

336
00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:23.500
Here we go!

337
00:20:27.350 --> 00:20:30.100
[LUFFY]
We're doin' it!

338
00:20:52.690 --> 00:20:56.610
You know, I'm starting to think
Wano isn't going to be very nice.

339
00:20:56.610 --> 00:20:58.200
I'm sick of this chaos!

340
00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:00.540
You guys! That's the shore over there!

341
00:21:07.510 --> 00:21:10.600
[Nami, Chopper scream]
No, not awesome!

342
00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:19.190
Luffy! Let go of the fish!

343
00:21:19.190 --> 00:21:21.280
No, never! They're my dinner!

344
00:21:22.070 --> 00:21:24.070
I've had enough of you!

345
00:21:25.490 --> 00:21:27.490
[NAMI]
Brook! Take the helm!

346
00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:28.990
As you wish, Nami!

347
00:21:39.840 --> 00:21:42.340
No use! The current's way too strong!

348
00:21:48.010 --> 00:21:50.960
Dammit! And we were almost there, too!

349
00:21:50.960 --> 00:21:55.180
[Chopper cries]
It was nice knowing you!

350
00:21:55.180 --> 00:21:56.890
Doctorine!

351
00:21:57.470 --> 00:21:58.930
[screams]

352
00:22:00.100 --> 00:22:03.390
Huh? Where're my koi?

353
00:22:03.390 --> 00:22:05.270
[NAMI]
Priorities, Luffy!

354
00:22:05.270 --> 00:22:06.350
[Luffy gasps]

355
00:22:18.030 --> 00:22:21.240
Oh no! We're getting flushed!
